Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:14:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 16/22] feat(audio): six original synthesised SFX for the EDL
 cue names

whoosh, pop, riser, ding, impact (a deep gritty boom) and sting,
generated by tools/assets/make_sfx.py from oscillators and filtered
noise: no samples, nothing to license, CC0 with the project. Before
this assets/sfx was empty, so every planned SFX cue was silent.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
